 "note": "Two reportable segments (Ind AS 108): Fertilizer products (urea, ammonium sulphate, DAP, APS, NPK, traded fertilisers) and Industrial products (caprolactam, nylon-6, nylon chips, melamine, methanol, MEK oxime, HX crystal, traded industrial products incl. ammonia). Annual figures are consolidated (segment note 40); segment result = EBIT before unallocated income (mostly dividends and interest) and unallocated expenses. Segment EBITDA = segment result + segment depreciation. centralCosts = sum of segment EBITDA less Screener consolidated EBITDA (= unallocated expenses net of unallocated depreciation, plus the ~Rs24 cr of other income that sits inside segment results in FY26). Quarterly segment figures are standalone, from the media releases with the results (consolidated adds GSFC Agrotech, ~Rs118 cr of fertiliser revenue in FY26); gaps are not disclosed. Quarterly segment depreciation is not disclosed.",
